sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Producer
    participant E as E (topic)
    participant Q as Q
    participant C as Consumer
    participant R1 as E.dlx_retry_1
    participant W as Q.wait_retry (TTL = ttl)
    participant R2 as E.dlx_retry_2

    P->>E: publish(routing_key)
    E->>Q: bound with #35;
    Q->>C: deliver (retry_count = 0)
    C-->>Q: nack (requeue = false)
    Note over Q,R1: Q has x-dead-letter-exchange = E.dlx_retry_1
    Q->>R1: dead-letter (reason: rejected)
    R1->>W: bound with #35;
    Note over W: waits ttl ms,<br/>nobody consumes
    W->>R2: expired, dead-letter (reason: expired)
    R2->>Q: bound with #35;
    Q->>C: deliver again (retry_count = 1)
    C-->>Q: ack
    Note over Q: message is gone,<br/>retry cycle ends
